<!--
  Nothing defective is listed here, on purpose. An orphan entry and a
  robots-disallowed entry used to live in this file, and they made the *good* site
  fail CI-008, AR-162, GO-137 and GO-138 — so those four checks were never once
  observed passing anything. A fixture cannot demonstrate the defect and the
  agreement in the same place.

  The orphan moved to the broken site, where a check that finds it is doing its job.
  The sitemap/robots conflict is covered by a unit test instead
  (Robots.test_a_robots_skipped_sitemap_url_is_not_an_orphan): it needs a robots.txt
  that disallows a listed URL, and the broken site's own defect is having no
  robots.txt at all. One origin cannot be both.
-->
